be able to call code written in another language. Maybe you need a particular part of 
your program to run extremely fast, or maybe you want to use a particular library 
thats implemented in C or Java. When that happens youll be grateful for Rubys 
extension mechanism, which lets you call C code from a regular Ruby program; and 
